2026-07-27T12:20:13.5565096Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T12:20:13.5624160Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T12:20:13.5624697Z i /tmp/RtmpAeaSwR/duckdb
2026-07-27T12:20:13.5625052Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T12:20:13.5625457Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:20:13.5625801Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:20:13.5626344Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:20:13.5627146Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:20:13.5628321Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T12:20:13.5879247Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T12:20:13.5984314Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T12:20:13.6414334Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T12:20:13.6562407Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
